      "channels": [
        {
          "name": "welcome",
          "writeRole": "admin",
          "topic": "👋 Start here: read the pinned messages, then say hi in #introductions.",
          "messages": [
            {
              "pin": true,
              "text": "# 👋 Welcome to the Iskra community\nThis is Iskra's own server: for people who use Iskra, host it, test it, or are just curious. Iskra is free, has no ads, and every server belongs to whoever runs it. This one included.\n\n**Find your way**\n- **#announcements**: new versions and news from the team.\n- **#help**: stuck? Ask here, for the apps or for running your own server.\n- **#feature-ideas**: what Iskra should do next. Vote with reactions.\n- **#show-your-setup**: your themes, profile pages and servers.\n- **Self-hosting**: home PCs, Raspberry Pis, rented servers and bots.\n- **Try things**: a playground with every kind of channel. Tap every button; you can't break anything important.\n- **Testers**: if you joined the test on Google Play or TestFlight, start with **testing-guide**.\n\nEach channel has a topic at the top that says what it's for."
            },
            {
              "pin": true,
              "text": "## 🐞 Found a bug? Report it in the app\n1. Tap **your name** at the bottom of the channel list. On a computer you can also press **Ctrl+Shift+B**.\n2. Choose **Report a bug**, write what happened and what you expected, and add a screenshot if you can.\n3. Tap **Send**. You get a report number.\n\nThe report goes straight to the Iskra team, with your words, your screenshots and some technical details. Never your messages, names or contacts. Tap **See what's included** to check before you send.\n\nQuestions and ideas: **#help** and **#feature-ideas**."
            }
          ]
        },
