  "rules": {
    "required": true,
    "welcome": "Welcome to the Iskra community! Please read these rules, then start in #welcome.",
    "text": "1. **Be kind.** People here come from everywhere, often writing in their second language. Be patient and friendly.\n2. **No personal data.** Don't post phone numbers, addresses, passwords, invite links to private servers or anything private, here or in screenshots.\n3. **Keep it clean.** No hate, harassment, spam, scams or adult content. The community guidelines apply: https://iskra.foo/terms#guidelines\n4. **Stay on topic.** Help in #help and #hosting-help, ideas in #feature-ideas, everything else in #general.\n5. **Report bugs in the app.** Tap your name at the bottom of the channel list, then Report a bug.\n6. **Things may change.** This server also hosts tests: channels in Try things and Testers can be reset."
  },
